break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれちいです(〃З〃)\nまいまい大好きん."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴょん."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３つ前のblogのことなんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんコメント\nありがとうございます."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルからして\nまひろがあまり元気ない感じだと\n思ってくださり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぐさめの言葉をくれたりだとか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勇気づけられました !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 ありがとう ."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴょん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あww ! !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日 日曜は 個別握手会 ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとお話しできること\n楽しみにしてます ."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるねん(*´▽`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/03/31/5591122/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分は\nこのコーディネートが\n1番 あきないし\nおちつく気がきします(〃‐〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Thank-you , Rottyより.のし"}],"source":"archive"}}